        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This game tells the story of four crumbling dimensions, where four adventurers search for answers to save their worlds. The art is quirky, yet each world has its own visual charm.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>has translations into Brazilian Portuguese and English, the game is Single Player, There are 3, plain map, cave map, snow map, there are 3 bosses on each map, and 3 villages on each map, NPC with dialogues, cutscenes, inventory item and character exchange system The game focuses on the story and platforming and adventure mechanics. Get ready to explore, face enemies, and uncover secrets as you enjoy this unforgettable journey! (This game is a small game made by one person. This game contains art by me and other artists — credits to them.)</strong></p>",
